  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\n2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Yellow Dragon Capsulated\nby\nPerth Mint\n✓ LBMA Good Delivery\n$\n90.30\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nMetal\nSilver\nWeight\n1 oz Troy Ounces\nPurity\n99.99\nType\nCoin\n186 In stock\nQty\nQuantity\nCheck/Wire\nCrypto\nCard/Paypal\n1-9\n1 - 9\n0%\n$\n90.52\n$\n92.33\n$\n95.05\n10-99\n10 - 99\n0.05%\n$\n90.47\n$\n92.28\n$\n95.00\n100+\n100 +\n1%\n$\n89.61\n$\n91.41\n$\n94.10\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nSKU:\ns1ocyeldra1\nCategories:\nGifts\n,\nGovernment Mint Silver Coins\n,\nGovernment Minted Silver Coins\n,\nReligious Collection\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Coins\nMint:\nPerth Mint\nPrice history\n2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Yellow Dragon Capsulated was last recorded at $90.18 on October 2, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is up 11.4% and has ranged between $76.89 and $155.39.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\nDiscover the stunning 2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Yellow Dragon Coin, a limited edition release from Perth Mint’s Lunar Series III. As we step into the Year of the Dragon, specifically the Wood Dragon, this coin celebrates the 2024 lunar year with a beautifully colorized yellow dragon, a potent symbol of power and wisdom in Chinese culture. With only 200,000 coins minted, this piece is a valuable addition to any collection or investment portfolio.\nKey Features:\nLimited Edition:\nOnly 200,000 coins minted, enhancing its rarity and desirability.\nExceptional Craftsmanship:\nMinted by the Perth Mint, renowned for its high-quality production and attention to detail since 1899.\nCultural Significance:\nCelebrates the Year of the Wood Dragon, offering a rich narrative for collectors and enthusiasts of the Chinese zodiac.\nInvestment Value:\nA sovereign coin backed by the Australian government, containing 1 oz of .999 fine silver.\nProduct Specifications:\nMint:\nPerth Mint\nCondition:\nNew, Brilliant Uncirculated\nDiameter:\n40.9 mm\nThickness:\n3.50 mm\nPurity:\n.9999 fine silver\nWeight:\n1 oz\nThe 2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Yellow Dragon Coin is not just an investment in silver but a piece of art that commemorates the Chinese Lunar Calendar. Available exclusively at Bullion Trading LLC, you can secure this exquisite coin from our New York store or through our online platform. Experience exceptional customer service and take advantage of this opportunity to own a symbol of wisdom and prosperity from the renowned Perth Mint.\nAdditional information\nMetal\nSilver\nProduct Type\nnumismatic_coin\nIssuer Country\nAU\nIs Legal Tender\nYes\nIs Monetized Bullion\nYes\nPurity %\n99.99\nWeight\n1 oz\nType of Bullion\nCoin\nWeight Unit\nTroy Ounces\nRelated products\nOut of stock\nRead more\n100 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver Bars\n,\nSilver Bullets for Sale\n100 Oz Pure Silver Bullet\n$\n6,396.90\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\n5 oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n,\nSilver Bullets for Sale\n5 oz Silver Bullet\n$\n384.94\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\nGifts\n,\nGram Silver Bars\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n100 x 1 Gram Valcambi Silver CombiBar\n$\n404.41\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n,\nSilver Coins\nPAMP Suisse Burton Morris Gorilla Shaped 1 oz Colorized Silver Coin\n$\n130.52\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\n$\n90.30\nAdd to cart\nLogin/Register\nDon't have an account\nRegister\nCustomer Login\nIf you have an account, sign in with your email address.\nContinue with Google\nLoading\nYour Cart\nCart is Empty\nUpdating Cart!\nHowdy,                             Guest\nSign in\nDepartments\nShop\nMints\nCart\nMy Account",
